### Sentiment Card Formula Reference

| Card               | Formula                                                                                       |
| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Trending**       | `watchingRate >= 40 OR (watchingRate >= 35 AND planRate >= 20)`                               |
| **Beloved**        | `score_9_10 >= 40 AND score_1_4 <= 8`                                                         |
| **HiddenGem**      | `score_9_10 >= 38 AND score_1_4 <= 8 AND members < 120000`                                    |
| **Polarizing**     | `score_9_10 >= 25 AND score_5_8 >= 45 AND score_1_4 >= 3`                                     |
| **High Dropoff**   | `dropRate >= 12 AND dropRate >= completionRate * 0.30`                                        |
| **Disliked**       | `score_1_4 >= 18`                                                                             |
| **High Retention** | `episodeCount != 1 AND completionRate >= 55 AND dropRate <= 8`                                  |
| **Mixed**          | `largestBucketShare < 35 AND score_5_6 >= 15 AND score_1_4 >= 7`                              |
| **Stalled**        | `onHoldRate >= 8`                                                                             |
| **Mid**            | `score_5_7 >= 50 AND score_9_10 < 30 AND score_1_4 < 15`                                      |
| **Broad Appeal**   | `score_1_4 <= 5 AND score_5_10 >= 90`                                                         |
| **High Interest**  | `planRate >= 50`                                                                              |
| **Niche**          | `score_9_10 >= 25 AND members < 250000 AND score_1_4 >= 4`                                    |
| **Obscure**        | `members < 25000`                                                                             |
| **Slowburn**       | `totalRuntimeMinutes >= 90 AND score_9_10 >= 18 && < 35 AND score_1_4 <= 5 AND dropRate <= 8` |

Manga
Card	Formula
Trending	readingRate >= 25 OR (readingRate >= 20 AND planRate >= 20)
Beloved	highScoreShare >= 55 AND lowScoreShare <= 5
HiddenGem	highScoreShare >= 38 AND lowScoreShare <= 8 AND members < 35000
Polarizing	highScoreShare >= 25 AND score5to8Share >= 45 AND lowScoreShare >= 10
High Dropoff	dropRate >= 10 AND dropRate >= completionRate * 0.25
Disliked	lowScoreShare >= 18
High Retention	completionRate >= 40 AND dropRate <= 10
Mixed	largestBucketShare < 45 AND score5to6Share >= 12 AND lowScoreShare >= 5
Stalled	onHoldRate >= 15
Mid	score5to7Share >= 50 AND highScoreShare < 30 AND lowScoreShare < 15
Broad Appeal	lowScoreShare <= 5 AND score5to10Share >= 92
High Interest	planRate >= 60
Niche	highScoreShare >= 25 AND members < 150000 AND lowScoreShare >= 4
Obscure	members < 12000
Slowburn	highScoreShare >= 25 AND highScoreShare < 50 AND dropRate <= 5 AND lowScoreShare <= 5 AND members > 15000

#### Notes


* All values are derived from live MyAnimeList API statistics
* Score share values represent percentage distribution across score ranges
* Only the top 5 qualifying cards are rendered per anime
* Cards are prioritized before rendering to avoid contradictory or low-signal combinations
* Manga suppression rules include: HiddenGem suppresses Beloved
* Disliked and Mid suppress Mixed so only one broad negative/middle reception card appears

